  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bce7decf-b565-54a3-9a02-865cd2767f75" activityNameId="64dd4d6a-7d26-516e-9fe4-2115bbd5b072" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silver, from combined metal production, at beneficiation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silver, from combined metal production, at beneficiation
This multi-output process "mining, gold-silver-zinc-lead-copper deposit" delivers the five co-products "gold/silver/copper/zinc/lead, from combined metal production, at beneficiation". The metals consisting of 1kg metal in the product, further refining is required for pure metal.\nThis data set includes the mining  in Sweden in open pit and underground mines incl. land use. Allocation is based on economic value.;
UUID: afd64f38-800f-307d-afd0-74012740d1db
This data set includes combined mining of gold, silver, copper, zinc and lead in Sweden incl. energy and material use, water and air emissions of metals and land use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: open pit mines and underground mines
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: &gt;2.32E7 t ore
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: See Geography, air emissions are estimated with data of one mine
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afd64f38-800f-307d-afd0-74012740d1db.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
